  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiated Partnership between UNICEF Aotearoa and MFAT to fund a multi-year, multi-country child focused programme in the Pacific (Vanuatu, Kiribati, Solomon Islands) and Southeast Asia (Timor Leste). This will be delivered through&#xa0;supporting investment in the early childhood and care&#xa0;education (ECCE) and in water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) in&#xa0;Schools.</narrative>
  </description>
